I once made a patch to the bottom-line displaying routine, so that my
prayer timeout was also displayed. From trying out, I found that your
prayer timeout decreases by one each turn, and is increased by a random
amount whenever you do something like praying or angering your god. It
is decreased by offering.

These amounts have a very large random factor in them, though. I have
seen the counter being reset from 0 to 83 when praying, but I have also
seen the counter jump to 1400 or so, after one little prayer. The
increase is larger when you are granted something. The random factor is
too big to give any precise number for the number of turns you must
wait, sorry...

